  "label": "Threatening Language",
  "description": "Threatening language is speech or writing intended to instill fear or intimidation. In this meme, the phrase 'you don't want to miss the water truck.....ya thirsty bitch' is a form of threatening language, implying that the target will suffer negative consequences if she does not comply. The background knowledge required to understand this is the concept of threatening language and its use in abusive contexts, which is outside the image but necessary to interpret the meme's intent.",
